    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddbe Giant Mechs \u00d7 Space Battles</h2>Pilot a humanoid mech and soar freely through outer space.<br>Engage enemies from every direction using full 3D tactical movement.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/230b60d08d984cab59ab6aec2f39bed3.poster.avif?t=1755404271\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/230b60d08d984cab59ab6aec2f39bed3.webm?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/230b60d08d984cab59ab6aec2f39bed3.mp4?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Auto-Aim FPS for Instant Action</h2>Keep enemies centered on your screen to auto-lock and fire.<br>Master inertia-based movement to chase down fast-moving targets.<br>True piloting skill means mastering motion in zero gravity.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3b41c40105b84c10c63764b3d9fa0029.poster.avif?t=1755404271\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3b41c40105b84c10c63764b3d9fa0029.webm?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3b41c40105b84c10c63764b3d9fa0029.mp4?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 Slash, Shoot, Explode \u2014 Master Four Sub-Weapons</h2>Missiles, grenades, beam blades, and shields.<br>Switch weapons on the fly to control the battlefield.<br>Your mech is built for both close-quarters and long-range combat. Note: This title does not feature mech customization.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/e5d37b08cdac150f408c917672cd1768.poster.avif?t=1755404271\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/e5d37b08cdac150f408c917672cd1768.webm?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/e5d37b08cdac150f408c917672cd1768.mp4?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Simple Story, Snappy Missions</h2>You\u2019re a rookie pilot, thrown into a war for your homeland.<br>Join a rough-edged strike squad and survive the front lines.<br>A short sci-fi narrative connects each high-paced mission.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3525f94a0a0591e0b4328a0098f5b835.poster.avif?t=1755404271\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3525f94a0a0591e0b4328a0098f5b835.webm?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3525f94a0a0591e0b4328a0098f5b835.mp4?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Coordinate Military Ops with Your Squad</h2>Follow your commander\u2019s orders and move fluidly through battle.<br>Support allied warships, defend key points, and adapt to a shifting battlefield.<br>Tactical awareness is key to survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/693da59b75c8596ced166dcb083113e8.poster.avif?t=1755404271\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/693da59b75c8596ced166dcb083113e8.webm?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/693da59b75c8596ced166dcb083113e8.mp4?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>",
