: This title does not feature mech customization.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/e5d37b08cdac150f408c917672cd1768.poster.avif?t=1755404271\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/e5d37b08cdac150f408c917672cd1768.webm?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/e5d37b08cdac150f408c917672cd1768.mp4?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Simple Story, Snappy Missions</h2>You\u2019re a rookie pilot, thrown into a war for your homeland.<br>Join a rough-edged strike squad and survive the front lines.<br>A short sci-fi narrative connects each high-paced mission.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3525f94a0a0591e0b4328a0098f5b835.poster.avif?t=1755404271\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3525f94a0a0591e0b4328a0098f5b835.webm?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123770/extras/3525f94a0a0591e0b4328a0098f5b835.mp4?t=1755404271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Coordinate Military Ops with Your Squad</h2>Follow your commander\u2019s orders and move fluidly through battle.<br>Support allied warships, defend key points, and adapt to a shifting battlefield.<br>Tactical awareness is key to survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/